{# AO·08 · THE SEAM, AS A CARD. What is installed here, what each contributed to THIS page, and
   the honest way to add another.

   The contribution counts are not a description — they are counted from what each module actually
   returned on this render, so a module whose provider went quiet says so here. #}
<div class="c">
    <span class="tab"><span class="idx">AO·08</span>Modules in this area<span class="src">· {{ by.host.installed|length }} installed · {{ by.host.catalogueCount }} in the catalogue</span></span>
    {{ include('area/overview/_ao_by.html.twig', {slug: 'host', who: 'host'}, with_context: false) }}

    <table class="tbl">
        <tr><th>module</th><th>contributes here</th><th class="num">since</th></tr>
        {% for module in by.host.installed %}
            {% set c = contributions[module.slug]|default({widgets: 0, tiles: 0, attention: 0, layers: 0}) %}
            <tr>
                <td><a href="{{ urls.modules }}"><i class="ao-dot {{ module.slug }}"></i>{{ module.name }}</a></td>
                <td class="fog">{{ c.widgets }} widget{{ c.widgets == 1 ? '' : 's' }} · {{ c.tiles }} now-tile{{ c.tiles == 1 ? '' : 's' }} · {{ c.attention }} attention item{{ c.attention == 1 ? '' : 's' }} · {{ c.layers }} map layer{{ c.layers == 1 ? '' : 's' }}</td>
                <td class="num mono ao-sm">{{ module.since ? module.since|date('M Y')|lower : '—' }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% else %}
            <tr><td class="d" colspan="3">No module is switched on in this area, so nothing operational is on this page.</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}

        {# THE OTHER HALF OF THE SEAM, AND THE REASON THIS IS A TABLE RATHER THAN A LIST. A
           catalogue module this area has not installed gets a row of its own, muted, contributing
           nothing — which is the honest reading of "8 in the catalogue" above two installed ones.
           Nothing is invented for it: its catalogue name, and the fact that it is not here. #}
        {% for module in by.host.absent %}
            <tr>
                <td class="d"><i class="ao-dot ao-dot-absent"></i>{{ module.name }}</td>
                <td class="d">nothing — not installed in this area</td>
                <td class="num d mono ao-sm">—</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </table>

    <div class="use">A module is installed <b>per area</b>. Everything it contributes appears the moment it is, and leaves
        the moment it is not — including its tiles inside the host’s own strip and its items inside the host’s own
        attention list.</div>
    <a class="open-btn ao-gap" href="{{ urls.customize }}">Add a module to this area →</a>
</div>
